sequenceDiagram
    participant D as Doll (sensor)
    participant N as Nest (gateway)
    participant V as Vercel API
    participant R as Runpod AI
    participant S as Supabase
    participant T as Teacher
    D->>N: book on, status
    N->>V: event (HTTPS + key)
    V->>S: insert once
    D->>N: recording
    N->>V: /v1/assess + audio
    V->>S: session lookup
    V->>R: grade
    R-->>V: code, word, score
    V->>S: insert score
    V-->>N: code,word
    N-->>D: act out feedback
    T->>V: GET dashboard (password)
    V->>S: read events
    V-->>T: dolls, scores
